    <briefdescription>
<para>Structure to map old mesh BitSets to new. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Structure to easily map topology of <ref refid="classMR_1a6e41979b347d16015b72249770957a48" kindref="member">MR.boolean</ref> input meshes to result mesh This structure allows to map faces, vertices and edges of mesh <computeroutput>A</computeroutput> and mesh <computeroutput>B</computeroutput> input of <ref refid="classMR_1a6e41979b347d16015b72249770957a48" kindref="member">MR.boolean</ref> to result mesh topology primitives <programlisting filename="cpp-examples/MeshBoolean.dox.cpp"></programlisting> <programlisting filename="cpp-examples/MeshBoolean.dox.cpp"></programlisting> <simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classMR_1a6e41979b347d16015b72249770957a48" kindref="member">MR.boolean</ref> Generated from class <computeroutput><ref refid="classMR_1_1BooleanResultMapper" kindref="compound">MR.BooleanResultMapper</ref></computeroutput>. This is the const half of the class.</para>
</simplesect>
